{"id":"1019687af4","t":"Feasting Lord in Another world","c":"cv","n":39,"l":39,"s":["ml","mg"],"k":{"ml":"feasting-lord-in-another-world","mg":"feasting-lord-in-another-world"},"u":1795768206403,"desc":"وبعد كل هذا الوقت، وبعد التفكير في الحياة الماضية، هل يُلزم المرء بأن يصبح بطلاً شجاعاً؟ كل ما أردته هو أن أعيش حياةً كريمةً، أُحب الطبخ والاستمتاع بالطعام اللذيذ، ولكن فجأةً، وجدتُ مجلس القرية بين يدي، وعُينتُ رئيساً له دون سابق إنذار. طمأنوني قائلين: “يا بني، الأمر ليس خطيراً. يكفيك حضور اجتماع المجلس مرةً واحدةً كل شهر”. لذلك، أنا على يقينٍ تامٍ بأن من خدعني إلى هذا المنصب فعل ذلك بخداعٍ ماكر.","type":"مانها","status":"OnGoing","genres":["اثاره","اكشن","ايسكاى"],"src":{"ml":"feasting-lord-in-another-world","mg":"feasting-lord-in-another-world"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"feasting-lord-in-another-world|/manga/feasting-lord-in-another-world/1/","mg":"feasting-lord-in-another-world|"},"2":{"ml":"feasting-lord-in-another-world|/manga/feasting-lord-in-another-world/2/","mg":"feasting-lord-in-another-world|"},"3":{"ml":"feasting-lord-in-another-world|/manga/feasting-lord-in-another-world/3/","mg":"feasting-lord-in-another-world|"},"4":{"ml":"feasting-lord-in-another-world|/manga/feasting-lord-in-another-world/4/","mg":"feasting-lord-in-another-world|"},"5":{"ml":"feasting-lord-in-another-world|/manga/feasting-lord-in-another-world/5/","mg":"feasting-lord-in-another-world|"},"6":{"ml":"feasting-lord-in-another-world|/manga/feasting-lord-in-another-world/6/","mg":"feasting-lord-in-another-world|"},"7":{"ml":"feasting-lord-in-another-world|/manga/feasting-lord-in-another-world/7/","mg":"feasting-lord-in-another-world|"},"8":{"ml":"feasting-lord-in-another-world|/manga/feasting-lord-in-another-world/8/","mg":"feasting-lord-in-another-world|"},"9":{"ml":"feasting-lord-in-another-world|/manga/feasting-lord-in-another-world/9/","mg":"feasting-lord-in-another-world|"},"10":{"ml":"feasting-lord-in-another-world|/manga/feasting-lord-in-another-world/10/","mg":"feasting-lord-in-anothe